00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:51,000
The world is a stage.

2
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:36,000
Joker: Folie à Deux is a drama, crime, thriller film directed by Todd Phillips.

3
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:21,000
While struggling with his dual identity, Arthur Fleck not only stumbles upon
true love, but also finds the music that's always been inside him.

4
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:06,000
Arthur Fleck, played by Joaquin Phoenix.

5
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:51,000
Lee Quinzel, played by Lady Gaga.

6
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:36,000
Jackie Sullivan, played by Brendan Gleeson.

7
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:21,000
Maryanne Stewart, played by Catherine Keener.

8
00:46:00,000 --> 00:46:06,000
Sophie Dumond, played by Zazie Beetz.

9
00:51:45,000 --> 00:51:51,000
Paddy Meyers, played by Steve Coogan.

10
00:57:30,000 --> 00:57:36,000
Joker: Folie à Deux is a 2024 American jukebox musical legal drama film directed by Todd Phillips
from a screenplay he co-wrote with Scott Silver, as the sequel to Joker (2019).

11
01:03:15,000 --> 01:03:21,000
Joaquin Phoenix stars as Arthur Fleck / Joker, reprising his role from the
first film, alongside Lady Gaga as Harleen "Lee" Quinzel.

12
01:09:00,000 --> 01:09:06,000
The supporting cast includes Brendan Gleeson, Catherine Keener, Zazie
Beetz, Steve Coogan, Harry Lawtey, and Leigh Gill.

13
01:14:45,000 --> 01:14:51,000
In the film, Arthur awaits trial for his crimes at Arkham State Hospital, where
he develops a romantic relationship with another inmate, Lee.

14
01:20:30,000 --> 01:20:36,000
Although Joker was intended to be a standalone film, its success
at the box-office sparked interest in a sequel.

15
01:26:15,000 --> 01:26:21,000
Warner Bros.

16
01:32:00,000 --> 01:32:06,000
eventually convinced Phillips and Phoenix to return, with more
creative freedom and a significantly greater budget.

17
01:37:45,000 --> 01:37:51,000
The film was announced in June 2022, with Gaga
and Beetz joining later that year.

18
01:43:30,000 --> 01:43:36,000
Principal photography took place in New York City, Los Angeles, and
Belleville, New Jersey, from December 2022 to April 2023.

19
01:49:15,000 --> 01:49:21,000
Joker: Folie à Deux premiered at the 81st Venice International Film Festival on
September 4, 2024, and was released in the United States on October 4.

20
01:55:00,000 --> 01:55:06,000
The film was poorly received by critics and became a box-office bomb,
grossing $208 million on a $190–200 million budget.

21
02:00:45,000 --> 02:00:51,000
Among its seven Golden Raspberry Award nominations, it won Worst Remake,
Rip-off or Sequel and Worst Screen Combo for Phoenix and Gaga.

22
02:06:30,000 --> 02:06:36,000
The film explores themes of asylum, villain,
musical, insane asylum, based on comic.

23
02:12:15,000 --> 02:12:21,000
The tone is intense and dark and emotional.
